This CLI is a hand-authored Go port of @gojinko/cli — the official Jinko
developer CLI maintained at https://github.com/jinkoso/jinko-dev-tools.
Command names, request envelopes, the token flow (offer_token →
trip_item_token → trip_id → checkout_url), and the observability
headers are intentionally identical to the upstream Node CLI so a
~/.jinko/config.yaml file works with either transport.

The Jinko BFF (https://mcp-bff.gojinko.com) is the contracted-supplier
API behind app.gojinko.com. It is not affiliated with CLI Printing
Press; this CLI ships under the printing-press-library catalog as a
hand-published entry per the convention documented in
.printing-press-patches.json.
